@startuml
title StorageRouteContext - Context Implemented, Storage Consumers Planned

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "Business Service" as Service
participant "StorageRouteResolver" as Resolver
participant "StorageRouteContext" as Context
participant "Business Repository" as Repository
participant "IdempotencyStorage" as Idem
participant "OutboxStorage" as Outbox

Service -> Resolver : resolve(RouteContext with typed shard key)
Resolver --> Service : StorageRoute(context, shardInfo, location)

Service -> Context : open(route)
activate Context

Service -> Repository : save order
Repository -> Context : current()
Context --> Repository : same StorageRoute

Service -> Idem : markSuccess
Idem -> Context : current()
Context --> Idem : same StorageRoute

Service -> Outbox : save event
Outbox -> Context : current()
Context --> Outbox : same StorageRoute

Service -> Context : close scope
deactivate Context

note right of Context
ThreadLocalStorageRouteContext must clear the route
when the outermost scope closes, otherwise thread pool
reuse may leak the previous route into the next request.
Consumers share shardInfo, but map their own tables.
RouteContext is input data, not this context store.
Idempotency / Outbox integration is not implemented yet.
end note

@enduml
